      fetchFields: ["`provider`: upstream provider used for this fetch (configured by the administrator).", "`pages[]`: fetched pages in input order; `number` is the position and `requestedUrl` echoes the original input.", "`errors[]` (optional): failed items with `url`, `code` and `message`.", "`rejectedUrls` (optional): inputs rejected for reasons such as non-http/https schemes."],
